(text "CAM_ENABLE enables digital I/O first. CAM_ANALOG_ENABLE then enables analog and VCM and the DVP buffers." (at 16 166.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 9999395d-dd09-5e6d-b206-5faa6aeefd18))
(text "With default PWDN high and RESET low: enable 1.8 V, wait for settling, enable 2.8 V, then wait at least 5 ms." (at 16 171.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 7cb71ed4-e73b-5fb4-a3ac-6f3fdc4d0478))
(text "Start XCLK, deassert PWDN, wait at least 1 ms, release RESET, then wait at least 20 ms before SCCB at 0x3C." (at 16 176.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid d2c15303-9dcf-5c45-96f3-393ea3463bbc))
(text "Shut down with PWDN high, RESET low, XCLK off, 2.8 V off and discharged, then switch off 1.8 V." (at 16 181.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 4c2d7c8c-0c0e-5742-853d-17d1069efd3f))
